msgid ""
"Rather than expanding your palette the normal way, use your incredible "
"telepathic powers to force yourself to be OK with untasty looking food.  At "
"least it gets the job done."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to appreciate the company of others by making yourself an "
"extrovert.  Hopefully you'll be able to find people to interact with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Stop yourself from enjoying the company of others by removing your "
"extroversion.  It's not like there's anybody around anyways, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to require the company of others by making yourself incredibly"
" sociable.  Hopefully you have friends."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Work on yourself by stopping your need for other's presence.  A workable "
"lifestyle turned problem which started with the death of everyone you knew "
"and loved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Make sure that you're happy alone by making yourself an introvert.  With near"
" everyone dead, this mindset just got a lot more viable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Stop yourself from enjoying being alone by removing your introversion.  You "
"now feel positively neutral."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to hate interacting with others.  What would have been a "
"debilitating mentality in pre-Cataclysm life might actually help you.  What's"
" the chance you'll actually have to talk to someone now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your instinctive hatred of social interaction is probably a bit much.  For "
"all that meeting other survivors is rare you should probably be more "
"receptive to their presence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you currently hate water, you can begrudgingly accept that it "
"would be easier if you didn't feel that way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You now have a lot more reasons to be outside while it's raining.  Being wet "
"doesn't really hurt you physically, and with your telepathic power you can "
"make sure it doesn't hurt you mentally either."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Replace therapy and many other normal, healthy options for getting over your "
"inability to use guns.  At least this method is quick."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Drastic times require dramatic measures.  Whatever your reason for not "
"driving, you can get over it with a small dose of major psychic surgery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you love travelling you can see the benefits of staying in one "
"place.  Psychically remove your desire to keep exploring."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as it hurts you you just cannot get over the dullness of familiar "
"places.  With a bit of psychic surgery, that dullness can get a good bit "
"brighter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even taking the time to consider this alteration of your head is making you "
"incredibly unhappy at your lack of travel.  You should really fix this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Logically speaking, your refusal to wear tainted clothing really isn't that "
"bad.  There may be some benefit to reducing your squeamishness, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Finding time to DM a game is probably not going to happen again.  Even so, by"
" spending an inordinate amount of time studying a DM'ing guide while under "
"the effect of your psychic powers you think you can get some ideas on how to "
"do it again but quicker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The government is gone and so are the owners of all these buildings.  And "
"trees.  And really everything flammable.  You think you can make yourself "
"enjoy the act a lot more than you may already do, but this may have some side"
" effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As fun as it is, you can begrudgingly agree that there's better things to do "
"than setting fires.  Put a hypothetical therapist out of business with your "
"psychic powers and fix that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Being able to lie could be an important part of your life… if there was even "
"anyone to lie to.  You doubt this would help you much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's still a couple of survivors around, and being good at lying to them "
"might give you some opportunities you otherwise would lack.  It might also "
"get you in trouble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even the thought of doing this makes you incredibly uncomfortable, but of all"
" the reasons to quite veganism, the complete destruction of your entire world"
" probably qualifies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Logically speaking, those things that kind of look human really aren't.  It "
"might currently feel uncomfortable, but it's hard to think of a real argument"
" against eating them.  May as well get over your emotions.  Telepathically!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You feel just fine eating those not-humans, but a tiny part of your brain "
"tells you that this might be a slippery slope.  It might not be logical, but "
"you can stop this immediately."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Completely disgusting, and potentially quite unhealthy.  However, given the "
"times it may be your only option.  Can you force yourself to enjoy the taste "
"of human flesh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As tasty as humans are, it's gotten you some negative looks from other "
"survivors when you accidently referred to your 'taste.'  Are you willing to "
"change yourself just to meet their expectations?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Help balance your mood by fixing the centers of your brain that are "
"responsible for regulating it.  Be a little more at peace with yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You've heard stories of people who heavily specialize in certain skills at "
"the expense of all others.  With a bit of work, you think you can replicate "
"this in yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Can you really care about all those other things that don't matter or even "
"make that much sense.  With a bit of telepathic brain surgery you can!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You can begrudgingly admit that an old candy wrapper might not be the most "
"useful thing in the world.  Help yourself physically drop it by mentally "
"dropping your hording sensibilities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"At least one of the voices recommended you do this, and they seemed "
"trustworthy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"It takes you a while to process information, far longer than the average "
"person.  You think you've identified the locations of your brain responsible "
"for this, and with a bit of telepathic power you can fix that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With some deep analysis of how your brain works while reading with your Speed"
" Reading power, you think you can replicate some of the efficiency caused by "
"it.  This will allow you to permanently read quicker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Help yourself stop getting addicted to things by analyzing the relevant "
"pathways and closing them up.  You won't be extra addictive anymore, but you "
"won't necessarily have any special resistance either."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Increase your inhibitions with a bit of psychic surgery.  Even beyond the "
"normal reasons, a good supply of alcohol and really any other addictive "
"substance is hard to come by nowadays.  Make sure you don't need them any "
"more than usual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix your damaged memory regions to allow you to remember all of that "
"important stuff better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve the memory regions within your brain, allowing you to recall "
"information far more easily.  Help make sure you don't forget things ever "
"again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Sugar already tastes pretty good.  You can increase those feelings and make "
"it taste even better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Sugar may taste amazing, but eating so much of it probably isn't healthy.  "
"Enforce your new diet by making it taste worse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As annoying as books may be, you think that it would be useful to not be so "
"bored while reading them.  Fix that with psychic power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Reading has been one of the most important skills that has let humanity rise "
"as far as it once did.  Make sure you spend more time doing it by making sure"
" that you love it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve the areas relegated to learning new information in your brain that "
"you've noticed are operating a little poorly.  This has no downsides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Take some notes on how you brain functions while you're in concentration "
"trances and permanently replicate a small part of that efficiency in your "
"head to help you learn everything quicker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve your 3D awareness and planning by adjusting your brain.  There's "
"definitely ways of packing that you're currently missing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Dramatically improve your 3D awareness by making several efficiency "
"alterations to your brain.  Seeing how things fit together will get a lot "
"easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You already have enough to be angry about right now, you don't need your "
"brain naturally being pissed off as well.  Instead of pills or therapy, use "
"your telepathic powers!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With a couple of notes from your Mood Stabilization power, you can "
"permanently alter your brain to make you happier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Winter already has some real issues for your survival.  There's no need for "
"you to be depressed on top of it.  Fix that up with some intricate mental "
"surgery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix your inability to remember locations and direct yourself by connecting "
"locations of your brain that were erroneously disconnected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With a deep analysis of how you remember locations you think you can improve "
"your ability to do so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Rewire your way of feeling pain into something slightly positive.  It will "
"still be incredibly distracting and debilitating, but at least you'll enjoy "
"it.  Hopefully not enough to intentionally seek it out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your enjoyment of pain has lead to too many bad decisions.  Get rid of it "
"before a zombie gets rid of you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The dream of a person struggling with their faith.  Force yourself to see "
"spirituality in everything by mentally adjusting your brain to mirror "
"somebody else's faith.  It may not be the typical way of finding "
"spirituality, but you reckon the end result will be similar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even your immense spirituality cannot compete with the horrors around you.  "
"Intentionally lose a major element of who you are so you don't have to deal "
"with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Use your psychic powers to forget all of your memories mandating you eat with"
" good manners; hopefully, you won't lose anything else important."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix up the regions of your brain responsible for predicting the actions of "
"others.  A surprisingly comprehensive surgery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Do something else"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You feel that you need to be an incredibly powerful telepath to make this "
"work"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "It's a good thing that all of those people don't really matter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Looking back at your past actions, you really hope you didn't do anything "
"that you will now regret."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your past desires were really holding you back.  Now you're more at ease with"
" what you must do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Nothing seems to matter anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Compared to your prior state, you are suddenly overwhelmed with emotion!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"How could you ever have let just a little bit of darkness affect you so much?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"How could you have ever thought that way?  Of all the silly things to feel, "
"especially in times like these"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and stomach simultaneously grown in relief at your food palette "
"expanding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Since there's so few people left alive, you're at least happy that you "
"generally enjoy their company."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Getting your energy from interacting with others was not the worst idea in "
"the world, but also not the best."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You absolutely love and absolutely need to be able to talk to people.  You "
"cannot believe that the Cataclysm is getting in the way of that!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you enjoy a good conversation, you've gotten over the reality that"
" people just aren't around anymore.  You'll have to live with that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Since there's so few people left alive, you are no longer forced to talk with"
" anyone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's definitely someone out there right?  Its a shame you cannot enjoy "
"your solitude anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You absolutely detest having to interact with anyone else!  Its a good thing "
"you'll never have to again!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your prior level of hatred of social interaction was a bit much.  You no "
"longer enjoy the solitude quite as much but you definitely don't have a "
"problem with other people anymore."
msgstr ""

